{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/OutdoorNavigation","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/Geofence","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/DynamicPois","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/ChatbotIntegration","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/IndoorModule"],"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This functionality let users share position in side an airport, and also to receive a share position in the App, open it in the proper map and even to navigate to it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You need to configure your app to manage this functionality. Your app must support universal link, here complete info.(https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/documentation\/xcode\/supporting-universal-links-in-your-app)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Universal Link in a nutshell","type":"heading","anchor":"Universal-Link-in-a-nutshell","level":2},{"text":"Step 1: Associated Domains","type":"heading","anchor":"Step-1-Associated-Domains","level":5},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You must define your url, e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/aena.demo.carto.solutions"},{"text":". Then in ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Signing & Capabilities"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" of your project settings, add ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Associated Domains"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" and add the domains.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineCont